{%- comment -%}
  lms-libib-url — the public Libib rental library URL (libib.com/u/littlemoviestore).

  Accepts:
  - join_id: {Number} optional. A Libib item's join_id
    (product.metafields.custom.libib_join_id, kept by the daily `libib tags`
    job). With it, the URL opens that movie's item; without it, the library.

  Usage:
  <a href="{% render 'lms-libib-url', join_id: product.metafields.custom.libib_join_id.value %}">
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  echo 'https://www.libib.com/u/littlemoviestore'
  if join_id != blank
    echo '?solo=' | append: join_id
  endif
-%}
